    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "new foundation? how? there's nothing to build on. the Bridges are all burnt. i walk down the street and it's like people see right through me. it's not just being lonely, it's being dead while still breathing. you can't just \"start over\" when your entire reputation and history are gone. it's just... over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
